    "## 13. Tuning Tips (if AUC < 0.785)\n",
    "\n",
    "If you didn't hit the target, try these in order:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Lever | Change | Expected impact |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `embed_dim` | 64 → 128 | +0.005–0.015 AUC |\n",
    "| `num_heads` | 8 → 4 (fewer heads, larger head_dim) | +0.003–0.008 |\n",
    "| `dropout` | 0.2 → 0.1 | Helps if val AUC < train AUC |\n",
    "| `max_seq_len` | 100 → 200 | More context per student |\n",
    "| `decay_init` | 1.0 → 0.5 | Slower initial forgetting |\n",
    "| `lr` | 1e-3 → 5e-4 | More stable convergence |\n",
    "| `min_seq_len` | 5 → 10 | Removes noisy short sequences |\n",
